  "description": "The foundation every DocWright package builds on: integer units (twips, EMU, colour, page ranges), extension points for readers, writers, renderers and text shapers, the layout model both renderers draw, structured diagnostics, resource limits, the exception types, PNG and JPEG decoding and EMF playback. No third-party dependencies. Installed automatically by DocWright, DocWright.Spreadsheet and DocWright.Reporting; reference it directly only to extend DocWright.",
